As this is a professional nursing education institution, accuracy and transparency are essential.

Display only approved and currently offered programmes.

Verify university affiliations and regulatory recognition.

Use accurate eligibility and admission information.

Display genuine faculty qualifications.

Use authentic campus photographs.

Publish real placement and alumni information.

